{"id":"n64702-8-9","stage":0,"title":"줄 · 弦","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64702-8-9-1","ko":"기타 고치려고 오셨습니까?","zh":"您是来修理吉他的吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기타","meaning":"吉他","explanation":"기타：吉他","readings":[{"term":"기타","audio":"/audio/2991f61ced07a61e82f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38467","senseId":"1","lemma":"기타","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고치려고","meaning":"修补，维修","explanation":"고치다：修补，维修；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"고치다","audio":"/audio/594fd99add1f497ba95b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18381","senseId":"1","lemma":"고치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오셨습니까?","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2991f61ced07a61e","term":"기타","zh":"吉他","audio":"/audio/2991f61ced07a61e82f4.mp3","entryId":"38467","definition":"一种用手指弹奏的乐器，前后扁平，中间内弯，长长的琴身上系有六根弦。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"594fd99add1f497b","term":"고치다","zh":"修补，维修","audio":"/audio/594fd99add1f497ba95b.mp3","entryId":"18381","definition":"修理出故障或不能用的东西，使其可重新使用。","pronunciation":["고치다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a7cd92e6a1cbebf76e3e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64702-8-9-2","ko":"네 줄이 끊어져서요.","zh":"是的，因为琴弦断了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줄이","meaning":"弦，琴弦","explanation":"줄：弦，琴弦；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64702","senseId":"8","lemma":"줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끊어져서요.","meaning":"断，被切断","explanation":"끊어지다：断，被切断；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"끊어지다","audio":"/audio/604575a92730ac00bf4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89809","senseId":"1","lemma":"끊어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"4e04e3938cc9c67e","term":"줄","zh":"弦，琴弦","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3","entryId":"64702","definition":"吉他、玄鹤琴等乐器里，用于发出声音的细长而绷紧的线。","pronunciation":["줄"]},{"id":"604575a92730ac00","term":"끊어지다","zh":"断，被切断","audio":"/audio/604575a92730ac00bf4b.mp3","entryId":"89809","definition":"丝、绳、线等连着的东西被切割而断开。","pronunciation":["끄너지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dddc07da9b236f8c1be5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.617,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=64702","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"8","sourceLevel":"초급","day":19,"sequenceScore":0.7429,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["您是来修理吉他的吗？","是的，因为琴弦断了。","这次假期您有什么打算吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["您是来修理吉他的吗？","是的，因为琴弦断了。","这次假期您有什么打算吗？"],"answer":1}]}
